  "subject": "a whole Sunday lost in a jjimjilbang, going back and forth between the eighty-degree charcoal kiln room and the ice room until the wall clock and the TV reruns stop making sense",
  "caption": "Korean psychedelic art rock in the style of Seoul's 2020s indie band scene, a hazy mid-tempo guitar-band track. Two electric guitars, one droning through a phaser and fuzz, one picking a bent, reverb-soaked melody; a melodic bass sliding under the vocal; loose floor-tom-heavy drums that lock into a heavy half-time groove on the chorus; a wobbling analog synth drone and a Mellotron flute line. Hazy, saturated mix with tape echo and wide stereo panning, the guitars swirling into a fuzz build in the bridge. Soft male tenor, drowsy and close in the verses, sliding up into falsetto on the chorus. 100 BPM, E minor. Drowsy, warped and quietly funny. No shoegaze wash, no trap, no autotune, no ballad piano, no EDM synths.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - phased guitar drone and slow floor tom]\n\n[Verse 1]\n일요일 아침 열 시에 들어왔어\n수건으로 양머리를 만들고\n숯가마 문을 밀면 팔십 도\n모래시계를 뒤집어 놔\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n둥근 황토 천장이\n천천히 돌기 시작해\n\n[Chorus]\n녹는다, 녹아, 벽시계도\n뜨거운 데서 차가운 데로\n식혜 한 모금, 맥반석 계란\n몇 시인지 묻지 마\n\n[Verse 2]\n얼음방에 누우면 귀가 울려\n옆 아저씨 코 고는 소리가\n베이스처럼 바닥에 깔려\n티비에선 아까 그 드라마가 또 해\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n발끝이 하얗게 시려\n다시 숯가마로 기어가\n\n[Chorus]\n녹는다, 녹아, 일요일도\n뜨거운 데서 차가운 데로\n계란 껍질이 손톱 밑에\n몇 시인지 묻지 마\n\n[Bridge - guitars swirl into fuzz, voice drenched in echo]\n손목에 찬 옷장 열쇠가\n아직도 따뜻해\n\n[Outro - feedback and drone fade]\n밖에 나오니 깜깜해\n월요일이 문 앞에 서 있어",
